# Cool the platen and shroud to a temperature
# Sets both zones to the temperature, turns their thermal control on and waits for
# each to reach it, for at most the minutes given. A zone already at or below it
# ends its wait at once. Cooling uses liquid nitrogen: its supply must be on and its
# exhaust vented outside the building. Both zones stay on, holding the temperature,
# until a step turns them off.
block cool to <temperature:number -150..30 C> within <minutes:number 1..600 min>
load rLACO

hvc platen {temperature}
hvc shroud {temperature}
hvc platen on
hvc shroud on
until platenT <= {temperature} C within {minutes} min
until shroudT <= {temperature} C within {minutes} min
